sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Studio as Code Intelligence Studio
    participant GitHub as GitHub API
    participant Remote as Upstream / Fork

    User->>Studio: Select "Prepare Contribution"
    Studio->>GitHub: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/forks
    alt No Fork Exists
        Studio->>User: Request Approval to Fork
        User->>Studio: Approve Fork
        Studio->>GitHub: POST /repos/{owner}/{repo}/forks
        GitHub-->>Studio: Fork created (https://github.com/user/repo)
    end

    Studio->>Studio: Create isolated branch: fix/codeintel-{task_id}
    Studio->>Studio: Apply Synthesized Patch
    Studio->>Studio: Execute Regression Test in Sandbox
    Studio-->>User: Present Complete Git Diff & Test Results
    User->>Studio: Review & Click "Approve Push & PR"

    Studio->>Remote: git push origin fix/codeintel-{task_id}
    Studio->>GitHub: POST /repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls
    GitHub-->>Studio: 201 Created (PR #42 URL)
    Studio-->>User: Contribution Live (https://github.com/owner/repo/pull/42)
